  "details": "Currently if you fail to target a player correctly it kicks you back to the menu. This makes it insanely frustrating when you are trying to moderate a moving player and keep missing. It would be much better if failing to hit a player just left you in target mode. You can already cancel targeting by either moving or pressing the escape key.\n\nIf there is still concern on someone being stuck in target mode, a text notification could appear on screen that says \"Press ESC or move to cancel targeting\" while you have the target cursor active.",
